{
    "title": "Sleeper Fantasy Sports",
    "description": "SLEEPERPICKS\r\n\r\n- Pick more/less on 2 or more players\r\n- Win up to 100x your money, only on Sleeper\r\n- Get up to $500 deposit match\r\n- Play Sleeper Picks with friends, copy each other's contests\r\n- NFL, NBA, MLB, College Football, NHL, and College Basketball, with more sports to come!\r\n- Make MLB Fantasy Season more fun by picking higher or lower on your favorite baseball players to win up to 100X your money!\r\n\r\nSCORES\r\n\r\n- Keep track of live NBA, NCAA basketball games for free\r\n- Real-time stats and scores for the NBA, NCAA, NHL, MLB, NFL, and more\r\n\r\nFEED\r\n\r\n- Get lightning fast news alerts across the NBA, NFL, MLB, NHL, NCAA, Soccer, and more\r\n- Breaking news and social content for every major sports league\r\n- Personalize your content feed with favorite teams and leagues\r\n\r\nPlay in fantasy leagues with your friends, completely free!\r\n\r\nFANTASY FOOTBALL LEAGUES\r\n\r\n- Compete with friends by managing a team of real NFL players\r\n- Experience a beautifully simple drafting interface\r\n- A next-level matchup interface\r\n- The fastest scores and stats\r\n- Mock draft, research, auction, and chat\r\n- Play in redraft, keeper, or dynasty leagues.\r\n\r\nDAILY DRAFTS\r\n\r\n- Queue up for a lobby and draft players for a single week's upcoming games\r\n- Drafts start every 5 minutes, 24 hours a day\r\n- Play in as many drafts as you like and win real cash\r\n- Love your team? Enter into bonus contests for even more action\r\n\r\nFANTASY BASKETBALL LEAGUES\r\n\r\n- Get your friends together for a full season of hoops!\r\n- We've re-invented gameplay to be strategic and fun every week\r\n- Enjoy redraft, keeper, and dynasty leagues\r\n- The fastest scores and stats in the business\r\n\r\nFANTASY LCS\r\n\r\n- Draft professional League of Legends players\r\n- Strategy: Pick & Ban champions every week\r\n- NEW! Samsung Fast Five bonus scoring settings\r\n\r\nCHAT\r\n\r\n- Blazing fast modern chat for every league and group\r\n- Send gifs, images, and more!\r\n- Direct message anyone, anytime\r\n\r\nBRACKET MANIA\r\n\r\n- Invite friends to play one of the most popular college basketball games\r\n- Make your Bracket tournament by picking teams you think will win the NCAA basketball tournament in March\r\n- Free to play, up to 10,000 people per Bracket pool. Customize your scoring options for the most fun brackets.\r\n\r\nSleeper is where friends hang out around sports.\r\n\r\nFor Sleeper Picks, must be at least 18 to enter. Higher age restrictions may apply. Not available in all jurisdictions. See https://support.sleeper.com/en/collections/3125886-dfs-sleeper-picks-and-daily-draft for full rules, terms, and conditions.\r\n\r\nResponsible Gaming\r\n\r\nWe are committed to protecting our users and helping them manage their play in a responsible manner. To assist users who may be susceptible to compulsive play in controlling their gameplay, Sleeper offers proactive tools, resources, and support to encourage healthy player behavior. For more information, visit https://support.sleeper.app/en/articles/5554499-responsible-gaming.\r\n\r\nCall: 1.800-426-2537 or access www.800gambler.org\r\n\r\nCall: 1.800-522-4700 National Council on Problem Gambling or access www.ncpgambling.org",
